+### REQ-HUGO-FP-001: Hugo Config Fingerprinting Algorithm
+
+**Purpose:** Deterministic fingerprint for Hugo configuration files
+
+**Algorithm:**
+1. Load hugo.toml or config.toml (whichever exists, prefer hugo.toml if both)
+2. Canonicalize:
