+### 2. Idempotent Writes
+
+```python
+from src.launch.resilience import write_if_changed
+
+# Only writes if content differs
+was_written = write_if_changed(
+    Path("output/result.json"),
+    json.dumps(result, indent=2)
+)
+
+if was_written:
+    print("File updated")
+else:
+    print("Content unchanged, write skipped")
+```
