+### Worker Pipeline
+
+The integrator executes sub-workers in strict sequential order:
+
+```
+TC-401: Clone inputs and resolve SHAs
+  ↓
+TC-402: Fingerprint repository
+  ↓
+TC-403: Discover documentation
+  ↓
+TC-404: Discover examples
+```
