+- Pass/fail verdict
+
+**Hash Comparison**:
+```
+Artifact                    | Run 1 Hash    | Run 2 Hash    | Match
+--------------------------- | ------------- | ------------- | -----
+repo_inventory.json         | a1b2c3...     | a1b2c3...     | ✓
+product_facts.json          | d4e5f6...     | d4e5f6...     | ✓
+snapshot.json (state only)  | g7h8i9...     | g7h8i9...     | ✓
