+### S-GAP-008-002 | BLOCKER | Idempotency mechanism unspecified
+**Spec**: specs/08_patch_engine.md
+**Evidence**: Lines 25-28 state "Patch apply must be idempotent" but do not specify HOW idempotency is achieved.
