+**Spec**: specs/state-management.md
+**Evidence**: Lines 14-29 define run states but no validation of allowed transitions.
+
+```
+Lines 14-29:
+## State model
+Run states:
+- CREATED
+- CLONED_INPUTS
+- INGESTED
+- FACTS_READY
+- PLAN_READY
+- DRAFTING
+- DRAFT_READY
+- LINKING
+- VALIDATING
