+#### Gate 13: Rollback Metadata Validation (Guarantee L)
+
+**Purpose**: Validate PR artifacts include rollback metadata (prod profile only)
+
+**Inputs**:
+- `RUN_DIR/artifacts/pr.json` (from W9 PRManager)
