+- `PR_EMPTY_AFFECTED_PATHS`: affected_paths array empty
+- `PR_AFFECTED_PATH_NOT_IN_DIFF`: Path in affected_paths missing from PR diff
+
+**Behavior by Profile**:
+- **prod**: BLOCKER if validation fails
+- **ci**: WARN if validation fails
+- **local**: SKIP (not run)
+
+**Timeout**:
+- local: N/A (not run)
+- ci: 5s
+- prod: 10s
+
+**Acceptance Criteria**:
