+- **Evidence:** Checked `specs/10_determinism_and_caching.md`, stable ordering rules, temperature=0.0 enforcement
+- **Result:** ✅ Guaranteed (33/40), ⚠ Conditional (3/40 LLM-based features), N/A (4/40)
